WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.651
- Congratulations.
- Oh my gosh, thank you.

00:00:01.651 --> 00:00:02.484
- [Kelly] You have a baby boy, right?

00:00:02.484 --> 00:00:03.630
- Baby boy, yes.

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.739
- [Kelly] Was it exciting?

00:00:04.739 --> 00:00:05.739
(audience applauds)

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:06.572
That's exciting.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:08.910
I, I was excited when I found out,

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.440
because I had a little girl, just like you

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.400
and then, I had a little boy.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.470
And I was, I was excited,
because I got one of both.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:14.303
Were you?

00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:15.360
- I'm, one of both.
- Yeah.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.950
- And I, I think I'm good.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:17.880
- You're done?
- Shop is closed.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.293
Yes, one of each.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:24.120
It's exciting, it
definitely was, you know,

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.280
just a different way, I did surrogacy.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.113
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:27.113 --> 00:00:27.946
- And...

00:00:27.946 --> 00:00:28.779
- [Kelly] That was the second time, right?

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:29.612
- The second time, yes.
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:31.980
- The first time I carried on my own.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.810
The second time I did surrogacy

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.820
and it's, I mean, it's amazing.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.250
- I wish I had known about that,
I had horrible pregnancies.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.810
I was like, hospitalized and so...

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:40.643
- Oh, my gosh.

00:00:40.643 --> 00:00:42.660
- Yeah, so, I, but I didn't
really even know about it

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.260
or know what it was, like in
my circle, but it's brilliant.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.400
- It's, it's amazing.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.100
I had reasons why I
couldn't carry my second.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:50.933
- No, me too.

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:51.766
- Right?
- Yeah.

00:00:51.766 --> 00:00:53.160
- And it's, it's such a
blessing that we have this

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.320
and I, my sister, Kim

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.910
had two babies through surrogacy.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.530
She had two that she carried on her own

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:00.930
and her last two were through surrogacy.

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.000
If it wasn't for Kimberly,

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.160
I definitely don't think I
would've been as comfortable.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:05.993
- You wouldn't have been aware.

00:01:05.993 --> 00:01:06.826
- [Khloe] I wouldn't have been aware,

00:01:06.826 --> 00:01:07.890
I wouldn't have known as much.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:10.260
I watched her go through her journey

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:13.410
and I'm so grateful for
how open she's always been

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:14.970
about her journey, because,

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.200
and not every journey's the same.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.360
Mine was very different from hers.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.193
- Yeah.

00:01:19.193 --> 00:01:23.160
- I think her journey was way more,

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.100
just, I think she was
more maybe not involved,

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:26.933
I don't know the term,

00:01:26.933 --> 00:01:28.350
but like, it was just
more comfortable for her.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:31.140
For me, I'm such a control freak.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:31.973
- Oh yeah, you'd be like,

00:01:31.973 --> 00:01:33.210
"What are they eating?
What are they doing?

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.080
What are they putting in their body?"

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:34.913
- [Khloe] You're a stranger,

00:01:34.913 --> 00:01:35.760
I just have to trust you.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.160
And I love my surrogate, she was amazing,

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:38.993
but I'm still like,

00:01:38.993 --> 00:01:40.950
"I need you sitting
next to me all the time.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.210
I need to know what you're doing.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.050
What are you eating?"

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.180
- Yeah.
- So, it was...

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.730
- I think I would've been
a little like that too,

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:48.563
had I known, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:48.563 --> 00:01:50.460
- And a control freak
I take as a compliment.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.651
So, I'm not offended
that I'm a control freak.

00:01:51.651 --> 00:01:52.484
- I don't know if it's like,

00:01:52.484 --> 00:01:53.970
a control, it's because people
always say control freak,

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:56.310
but it's like, or you just
know what you want and like.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:57.143
- You're very particular.

00:01:57.143 --> 00:01:59.010
- [Kelly] Yeah, I think that
that's fine, it's, it's...

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:00.672
- It's not fine for other people.

00:02:00.672 --> 00:02:01.740
- It cuts through the BS.
- It's great for me.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:04.243
- You know, yeah, I think
they just need to get over it.

00:02:04.243 --> 00:02:07.410
So wait, so you, you haven't
revealed your son's name yet.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:10.110
So, is there a, is it like
a family name, like a hint?

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:10.950
Like...
- Well...

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:11.910
- [Kelly] Is it like...

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:13.950
- My daughter says his
name is Snowy and...

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.420
- [Kelly] Oh, your daughter.
(Kelly chuckles)

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.763
- It's not snowy, so that's the hint.

00:02:16.763 --> 00:02:17.596
(Khloe laughs)

00:02:17.596 --> 00:02:18.690
- I was like, "Were you a
big Game of Thrones fan?"

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:19.523
- Oh, my gosh.

00:02:19.523 --> 00:02:20.356
- Jon Snow.
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:20.356 --> 00:02:21.570
- I swear she just,

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.700
does things to sort of mess with me,

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.293
but his name is not Snowy.

